WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.935
Name each translation key by
where its text appears and what

2
00:00:03.935 --> 00:00:07.440
it means, such as
checkout.summary.title.

3
00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:09.996
Give each use its own key,

4
00:00:09.996 --> 00:00:13.758
because German translates the
button Open as Öffnen and the

5
00:00:13.758 --> 00:00:15.463
status Open as Offen.

6
00:00:16.150 --> 00:00:19.796
General Translation's &lt;T&gt; component
keeps English in your code,

7
00:00:19.796 --> 00:00:21.072
with no key to name.

8
00:00:22.150 --> 00:00:27.224
Wrap JSX in &lt;T&gt;, and npx gt
translate extracts the English

9
00:00:27.224 --> 00:00:28.209
from your source.

10
00:00:28.650 --> 00:00:31.657
Distinct uses of Open
still get context,

11
00:00:31.657 --> 00:00:34.791
through the context prop
or the $context option.

12
00:00:35.150 --> 00:00:38.505
Teams that want keys can
keep them in one dictionary,

13
00:00:38.505 --> 00:00:40.408
read with useTranslations.
